{"headword":"גָּדַל","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. grow up, become great (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדַל</span> (Ithpe.), <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܕܰܠ</span> <em>twist, twine</em>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جَدَلَ</span> <em>twist a cord, make firm, strong, become strong</em>, so NH<strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> etc. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:14\" href=\"/Genesis.38.14\">Gn 38:14</a> + 14 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֵלַנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:18\" href=\"/Job.31.18\">Jb 31:18</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְדַּל</span> etc. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:27\" href=\"/Psalms.35.27\">ψ 35:27</a> + 34 times;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>grow up</em>,"},{"senses":[{"definition":"child <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:8\" href=\"/Genesis.21.8\">Gn 21:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:20\" href=\"/Genesis.21.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:27\" href=\"/Genesis.25.27\">25:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:11\" href=\"/Genesis.38.11\">38:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:14\" href=\"/Genesis.38.14\">14</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:10\" href=\"/Exodus.2.10\">Ex 2:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:11\" href=\"/Exodus.2.11\">11</a> (JE) <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:2\" href=\"/Judges.11.2\">Ju 11:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:24\" href=\"/Judges.13.24\">13:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 1:13\" href=\"/Ruth.1.13\">Ru 1:13</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.21\">1 S 2:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 3:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.3.19\">3:19</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.8\">1 K 12:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:10\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.10\">10</a> (= <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 10:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.10.8\">2 Ch 10:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 10:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.10.10\">10</a>) <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.18\">2 K 4:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֵלַנִי כְאָב</span> <em>he grew up to me as to a father</em> <a d